{"4836500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HypnoFish Inc.", "steam_appid": 4836500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5039040], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HypnoFish Inc. is a first-person incremental game about hypnotizing fish and selling them for profits.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into crystal clear waters and hypnotize as many fish as you can before your oxygen tank runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/e13a400006daed31fb1dc6e54708573a.poster.avif?t=1787775740\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/e13a400006daed31fb1dc6e54708573a.webm?t=1787775740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/e13a400006daed31fb1dc6e54708573a.mp4?t=1787775740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your catch to unlock upgrades and purchase new equipment to increase profits and reach new depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/631d9da17ec02bc552146df14bd198c9.poster.avif?t=1787775740\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/631d9da17ec02bc552146df14bd198c9.webm?t=1787775740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/631d9da17ec02bc552146df14bd198c9.mp4?t=1787775740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive deeper, uncover the mystery of what HypnoFish Inc. has been hi