75740\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/631d9da17ec02bc552146df14bd198c9.webm?t=1787775740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/631d9da17ec02bc552146df14bd198c9.mp4?t=1787775740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive deeper, uncover the mystery of what HypnoFish Inc. has been hiding...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/2fd6acbc9367c1a2d30bd184acfcedf2.poster.avif?t=1787775740\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/2fd6acbc9367c1a2d30bd184acfcedf2.webm?t=1787775740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/extras/2fd6acbc9367c1a2d30bd184acfcedf2.mp4?t=1787775740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "HypnoFish Inc. is a first-person incremental game about working for the world's largest fishing corporation. Hypnotize fish, sell your catch, purchase upgrades, and uncover the mystery of this fishy business!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/05ef1fb3b73679adece6f1fe10e9b902413c8b1d/header.jpg?t=1787775740", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/46f103ec97eb121929a35261bd1ae11080d1fdf7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787775740", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836500/46f103ec97eb121929a35261bd1ae11